    "category": "classfeature",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You give your pawn an additional means of attack. Choose a melee or ranged unarmed Strike and its damage type when this Schematic is installed.</p><p><strong>Melee</strong> 1d6 damage (bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing), brawling group, finesse and unarmed traits.</p><p><strong>Ranged</strong> 1d6 damage (bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing), a 20-foot range increment, sling group, unarmed trait.</p><p><strong>Advanced Armament (maestro feat 8):</strong> the die becomes 1d8, and the maestro chooses one more modification when installing this Schematic. Not yet automated; the GM applies it by hand.</p>"
    },
